    "en": "Original whole organism with deep angular narrow head and robust limbs; not generic broad flat salamander or isolated skull. [\"Skin colour, tissue thickness, pose and visible digit detail are artistic; do not label exact soft tissue or toe count fossil-proven.\", \"Composite whole-body diagram is a scientific reconstruction, not photograph of one complete specimen.\", \"Museum image and UCL fullPDF downloads403, not visually inspected; body diagram available and inspected.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 1.9, \"basis\": \"Artistic adult target within Field Museum reported6–6.5ft range, not exact measurement of named specimen. Skeleton reference10cm bar.\"}",
